  "system": {
    "identifier": "retreating-shot",
    "description": "<p>After you take damage from another creature, you quickly retreat and you reset your positioning. Move up to 15 feet to a space you can see, that can hold you and then make a ranged taijutsu attack, dealing your [Weapons damage] + 3d6 and forcing the target to make a Strength saving throw, reducing their speed by 15, on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: Increase the distance you can move to your movement speed.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: Attacks you make against a creature while engaged with them are not made with disadvantage.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d10.</p>",
